models, the results suggest that the piecewise linear model is an
improvement over the simple linear model. Yet, the residual deviance for
the piecewise model is higher than the residual deviance in the simple
linear model. I don't understand why that would be the case. Any ideas?

Thanks for your help!

-Paul

