From tplate at blackmesacapital.com  Tue Jan 10 01:08:30 2006
From: tplate at blackmesacapital.com (Tony Plate)
Date: Mon, 09 Jan 2006 18:08:30 -0700
Subject: Re: handling octals generated by importData
