This is a nice exercise, thank you.
Rich

I have two methods.

dd <- data.frame(a=1:10, b=11:20, cc=21:30, d=letters[1:10])
v <- c(1,2,3,3,2,1,1,2,3,3)
cbind(1:10, v)
